Date: Thu, 24 Jul 2025 11:33:25 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] le-cam-server: add support for new system event

- Implement handling of system event messages.
- Forward these events to the clients for further processing.
- Enabled for qcs8300 targets

Change-Id: Iacbfdf4c4f39bdaffebbe21296bd96c6475146db
